# NoCapOS image: what the NoCapOS layer needs from Debian. The bigger host
# packages (virtual machines, Samba, media, ZFS, Docker) come with the
# first-boot run of the installer, the same as a one-line install.
ca-certificates
curl
sudo
openssh-server
avahi-daemon
libnss-mdns
smartmontools
unattended-upgrades
apt-listchanges
plymouth
plymouth-themes
initramfs-tools
grub-common
locales
console-setup
keyboard-configuration
network-manager
# NoCap Desktop clipboard agent (cap clipboard agent): Wayland and X11 clipboards.
wl-clipboard
xclip
firmware-linux-free
